  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">NTA UGC NET June Exam City Details 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-10T15:58:33+05:30\">June 10, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">3:58 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://ugcnet.nta.ac.in/\">National Testing Agency (NTA)</a></strong> has released the <strong>Exam City Details</strong>&nbsp;on its <strong>official website</strong> for the exam of <strong>UGC National Eligibility Test NET Assistant Professor / JRF June 2026 Examination.</strong> The&nbsp;<strong>Exam</strong>&nbsp;<span data-teams=\"true\">will be conducted on<strong> 22 – 30 June 2026</strong></span><strong>,</strong>&nbsp;The&nbsp;<strong>NTA</strong>&nbsp;application process started on&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"339\">29 April 2026</strong>, and candidates were able to submit their applications until&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"424\">24 May 2026</strong>. Candidates can check their&nbsp;<strong>Exam City Details </strong>using their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;by logging into the&nbsp;<strong>portal. The direct link</strong>&nbsp;is provided below.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">NTA UGC NET June Exam City Details 2026 – Out</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">NTA UGC NET June Examination 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/nta-ugc-net-june-2025/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Apply Online start Date : <b>29 April 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Apply Online Last Date : <b>24 May 2026 (Extended) 11:50 PM</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Pay Exam Fees Last Date :&nbsp;<b>24 May 2026 11:50 PM</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Correction Date :</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;26-28 May 2026</span></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date : 22-30 June 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam City Details : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>10 June 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card Available :&nbsp;<b>15 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Declared Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>Will Be Updated Here Soon</b></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>NTA</strong><b>&nbsp;</b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> General </strong>: <strong>₹ 1150/-&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> OBC, EWS </strong></span>: <span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>₹ 600/-&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC/ ST/PH</strong>&nbsp;: <strong>₹ 325/-&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">NTA UGC NET June Notification 2026 : Age Limits As On NTA Rules.</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>JRF</strong> : Maximum Age :<b> 31 Year</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>NET</strong> : <strong>No Age Limit</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Additional Age Relaxation as per <strong>UGC NET June 2026</strong> Examination Guidelines</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">Not Available</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">NTA UGC NET June Online Form 2026 : Course Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 200px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 25.5796%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Course</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.3584%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 30px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 25.5796%; text-align: center; height: 175px;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">UGC NET JRF June Examination 2026</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.3584%; height: 175px;\" rowspan=\"5\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates who have passed or are appearing in a Master’s degree in the relevant subject with at least 55% marks are eligible. </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Those with a 4-year Bachelor’s degree are also eligible.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/up-get-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET Online Form 2026</a></span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download NTA UGC NET June Exam City Details 2026</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Visit the official NTA UGC NET website.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Click on the <strong data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"177\">“UGC NET June 2026 Exam City Intimation Slip”</strong>&nbsp;link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Enter your <strong data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"221\">Application Number</strong>,&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"249\">Date of Birth/Password</strong>, and Security Pin.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Click on the <strong data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"302\">Submit/Login</strong>&nbsp;button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Your allotted exam city details will be displayed on the screen.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Check the exam city, exam date, and other details carefully.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Download the Exam City Intimation Slip PDF.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Take a printout for future reference and travel planning.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Keep checking the official website for the release of the Admit Card.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;NTA UGC NET June Online Form 2026 : Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</span></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Online Computer-Based Test (CBT)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Merit List</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility for Assistant Professor and/or JRF</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Final Result Declaration</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\">Join Our WhatsApp Channel</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VavXmlBEAKWFRHeXwL28\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052