ckground-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Check Date Extend Notice</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s301eee509ee2f68dc6014898c309e86bf/uploads/2026/05/202605201462069560.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><b>Click Here</b></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Download Official Notification</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s301eee509ee2f68dc6014898c309e86bf/uploads/2026/04/20260429104536285.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Check Syllabus &amp; Exam Pattern</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://www.ugcnetonline.in/syllabus-new.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>NTA Official Website</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://ugcnet.nta.ac.in/\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><b>Click Here</b></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;NTA UGC NET June Exam City Details 2026 : Important Question&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> <strong data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"132\">When will the NTA UGC NET June 2026 Exam City Intimation Slip be released?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><strong style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">Answer:</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"> The Exam City Intimation Slip is released online by NTA before the examination to inform candidates about their allotted exam city.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> <strong data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"337\">How can I check the UGC NET June 2026 Exam City Details?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Candidates can check their exam city details by logging in to the official UGC NET portal using their Application Number and Date of Birth/Password.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> <strong data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"563\">Is the Exam City Intimation Slip the same as the Admit Card?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> No, the Exam City Intimation Slip only provides information about the allotted exam city. The Admit Card is issued separately.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> <strong data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"767\">What details are mentioned in the Exam City Intimation Slip?</strong></span></li>\n<li><strong style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">Answer: </strong>The slip generally contains the candidate’s allotted exam city, exam date, and other important examination-related information.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <b>NTA</b>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <strong>NTA</strong> is <strong>https://ugcnet.nta.ac.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-36315 aligncenter\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-48-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"NTA UGC NET June Exam City Details 2026\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-48-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-48-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-48-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-48.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></p>\n<p></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n\n<p c